NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE.

This software is a research and educational demonstration. It is not cleared or
approved by any regulatory body, it has not been validated on a prospective
clinical cohort, and it must not be used to inform the care of a real patient.

The NEWS2 implementation follows the published Royal College of Physicians
scoring table, but a faithful implementation of a score is not a clinical
decision system: no alerting threshold here has been calibrated against a real
ward's event rate, and the machine-learning channel is trained on a public
retrospective dataset whose case mix will not match any particular unit. Its
held-out performance is reported honestly in README.md and artifacts/model_card.json,
including the figures that are weak.
